interface.longDescription:
Remoto by ProZ.com is a marketplace for professional human interpreters: on-demand video and audio calls, a dial-in phone line, scheduled calls, sign language (including ASL) and remote simultaneous interpreting for events, in 300+ languages.

Ask ChatGPT to:
- explain Remoto's services and which one fits your situation;
- recognise a language from an informal name ("Farsi", "Brazilian Portuguese", "ASL");
- check whether a language pair is covered, and whether someone can connect now or you should book ahead;
- show what an interpreter call will cost, per minute or for a scheduled call;
- search the public interpreter directory by language, specialty (medical, legal, education and more), country and who is online now, and open a public profile;
- show when an interpreter can be booked;
- answer questions from Remoto's help center, including security and HIPAA;
- give you a link that opens Remoto with your languages filled in.

This plugin is read-only and needs no sign-in. It never books, charges or contacts anyone: you start or book the call on Remoto's own website.

Please do not share patient names or other health details in the chat: AI connectors are not covered by a HIPAA Business Associate Agreement. Healthcare organisations that need a BAA can request one from remoto.support@proz.com.
